  "description": "Production-grade security, cryptography, and authentication engine for .NET. Features reversible authenticated token generation, client secret and asymmetric public/private key authentication, OAuth2 token issuance, AES-256-GCM AEAD encryption/decryption, deterministic keyed hashing for blind indexing, PBKDF2 password hashing, TOTP (RFC 6238) two-factor authentication, prefixed API keys, and sensitive data masking.",
